  "short_description": "在《巫奇魔法學院》這款讓人著迷的生活模擬遊戲中發現魔法，解開各式謎團。遊戲支援最多4人一同遊玩。作為初到Mossport這座熱鬧非凡的濱海城鎮的巫師，開始你的新生活。結交朋友、發展戀情。從校園生活到畢業後的嶄新人生，在這個魅力無限的奇妙世界中，書寫屬於自己的故事吧！",
  "short_description_en": "Discover magic and mystery in Witchbrook, a spellbinding witch life-sim for up to 4-players! Start your life as the newest resident witch in the bustling seaside town of Mossport. Make friends, find love, and discover a world filled with wonder and charm on the road to graduation and beyond...",
